### Server

`JWT_SECRET=` e.g. this_is_secret_123 or anything

`MONGODB_URL=mongodb://localhost:27017/ + name of database` e.g. mongodb URL

`STRIPE=`e.g. Secret key from stripe dashboard

`NODE_ENV=development` e.g. 'development' for local and 'production' for production

### Client

`VITE_API_URL=` e.g. http://localhost:3000/api or production deployed server link

`CLOUDINARY_ENV=` e.g. cloudinary environment

`VITE_CLOUDINARY_PRESET=`e.g. cloudinary preset

`VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=` e.g. cloudinary cloud name

`VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=` e.g. Publishable key from stripe dashboard